Z||000004||lildevil||08-23-2001||07:38 PM||||C'mon...lets do this. Lets show the world what these cars can do!  I am in with my car. Wheres Jason Haughy....Kieth Gerhard...ChrisMOore or Jay in Canada?  Lets get some v-8's,Northstars ,3.8's ,and fast stock engined cars.  I figure the shootout will happened in November but its goin to depend on when we get the stuff sent in.  Its goin to be in Englishtown PA . I think the condition of  the car does matter as they want pics.  But send em anyways!  <P>------------------<BR>Earl Sessions<BR>1985 Fiero w/ 1998 Supercharged 3.8 V-6<BR>Best ET: 13.311 @100.75 mph<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/water3quarterthumb.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000005||NOS3800||08-23-2001||11:22 PM||||You DEFINETLY need a drivers liscense and that means you will need to be at least 16. No where does it state that there is a minimum age, but you need a liscense. The cars are picked by the editors of the magazine. SO far, all the cars I have seen tested are in good condition, no primer or mismatched parts. Besides, we want to make a good showing, so cars of good quality in appearance should be preferred. <BR>Basically all it is is drag racing. You get like 8 runs and they just record them with descent write ups about your car and the owner. They show your times and compare with others. Alot of pics of each car too.||||reg||1
